New-Item .gitignore
```
Then open `.gitignore` in VS Code and paste this inside:
```
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
*.pdf
.DS_Store
pyrightconfig.json
```
**Important** — `.env` is listed here so your API keys are never pushed to GitHub.

---

## Step 5 — Go to GitHub and create a new repository
```
1. Open https://github.com
2. Click + → New repository
3. Name it: medical-hybrid-rag
4. Set to Public or Private
5. Do NOT check "Add README"
6. Click Create repository
7. Copy the repository URL shown
   e.g. https://github.com/yourname/medical-hybrid-rag.git